{"3884940":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Number Dungeon","steam_appid":3884940,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3884940\/extras\/364f24527a0b0af9278da9e979c7155c.avif?t=1770510086\" alt=\"NUMBER DUNGEON\" width=614 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3884940\/extras\/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.poster.avif?t=1770510086\" width=614 height=326 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3884940\/extras\/c42d2a5d33fcbd974da0ff650baf7226.mp4?t=1770510086\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Welcome to the dungeon!<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Inspired by the tabletop card game Scoundrel Solitaire, Number Dungeon does away with the four suits, and in its place has dozens upon dozens of potential encounters incorporating the monster-item-weapon formula. Strategy is key in this numbers game - know which move is the best at any given time to clear any dungeon you face!<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/3884940\/extras\/4713aa140a8d15ef96e0cf1c223fca0a.avif?t=1770510086\" alt=\"DUNGEONS A PLENTY\" width=614 height=80 \/><\/span><\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><i><strong>Strategize to succeed!<\/strong><\/i><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >See if you can clear set &quot;trials&quot;, holding true to this game's Scoundrel Solitaire roots. First take on a recreation of the classic, then take on more advanced decks that twi